<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>驴打滚</title>
<style>
* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
body {
  background: #87ceeb;
  min-height: 100vh;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  font-family: serif;
}
.title {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px 0 10px;
  font-size: 2.2rem;
  color: #3d2b1f;
  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #f0d080;
  letter-spacing: 8px;
}
.subtitle {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: #5c3d1e;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.stage {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 220px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.grass {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 70px;
  left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 30px;
  background: #6ab04c;
}
.dirt {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 70px;
  background: linear-gradient(#c8a96e, #b5934d);
}
.donkey-wrap {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 55px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  animation: rolling 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes rolling {
  0%   { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(0deg); }
  25%  { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(90deg) translateY(-8px); }
  50%  { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(180deg); }
  75%  { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(270deg) translateY(-8px); }
  100% { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(360deg); }
}
.dust-wrap {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 48px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 160px;
  height: 30px;
}
.dp {
  position: absolute;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(180,140,80,0.6);
  animation: df 1.5s ease-out infinite;
}
@keyframes df {
  0% { opacity: 0.7; transform: translate(0,0) scale(1); }
  100% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(var(--x), -28px) scale(1.6); }
}
.dp1{width:12px;height:8px;left:20%;--x:-14px;animation-delay:0s;}
.dp2{width:8px;height:6px;left:45%;--x:10px;animation-delay:0.4s;}
.dp3{width:14px;height:9px;left:65%;--x:16px;animation-delay:0.8s;}
.dp4{width:9px;height:7px;left:10%;--x:-8px;animation-delay:1.1s;}
.card {
  margin: 14px auto 0;
  width: 88%;
  max-width: 360px;
  background: rgba(255,248,220,0.96);
  border: 2px solid #c4943a;
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 14px 18px 16px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
}
.card-title {
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  color: #8b3a0f;
  text-align: center;
  border-bottom: 1px dashed #c4943a;
  padding-bottom: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.card-text {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: #5c3d1e;
  line-height: 1.9;
  text-align: justify;
}
.card-foot {
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 10px;
  font-size: 1.2rem;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="title">驴打滚</div>
<div class="subtitle">🫏 正在努力表演中 🫏</div>

<div class="stage">
  <div class="grass"></div>
  <div class="dirt"></div>
  <div class="dust-wrap">
    <div class="dp dp1"></div>
    <div class="dp dp2"></div>
    <div class="dp dp3"></div>
    <div class="dp dp4"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="donkey-wrap">
    <svg width="110" height="82" viewBox="0 0 120 90">
      <ellipse cx="60" cy="55" rx="32" ry="20" fill="#b0a090"/>
      <rect x="72" y="37" width="13" height="21" rx="6" fill="#b0a090" transform="rotate(-10,78,47)"/>
      <ellipse cx="88" cy="30" rx="16" ry="13" fill="#b8a898"/>
      <ellipse cx="81" cy="18" rx="4" ry="9" fill="#b8a898" transform="rotate(-15,81,18)"/>
      <ellipse cx="81" cy="18" rx="2.5" ry="6" fill="#e8b0b0" transform="rotate(-15,81,18)"/>
      <ellipse cx="93" cy="17" rx="4" ry="9" fill="#b8a898" transform="rotate(10,93,17)"/>
      <ellipse cx="93" cy="17" rx="2.5" ry="6" fill="#e8b0b0" transform="rotate(10,93,17)"/>
      <circle cx="92" cy="27" r="4" fill="#2c1a0e"/>
      <circle cx="93" cy="26" r="1.5" fill="white"/>
      <ellipse cx="100" cy="34" rx="7" ry="5" fill="#c8b8a8"/>
      <circle cx="98" cy="34" r="1.5" fill="#7a5040"/>
      <circle cx="102" cy="34" r="1.5" fill="#7a5040"/>
      <path d="M95 38 Q100 43 105 38" stroke="#7a5040" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <rect x="36" y="68" width="9" height="18" rx="4" fill="#9a8878"/>
      <rect x="50" y="68" width="9" height="18" rx="4" fill="#9a8878"/>
      <rect x="64" y="68" width="9" height="18" rx="4" fill="#9a8878"/>
      <rect x="78" y="68" width="9" height="18" rx="4" fill="#9a8878"/>
      <rect x="35" y="83" width="11" height="5" rx="2" fill="#4a3828"/>
      <rect x="49" y="83" width="11" height="5" rx="2" fill="#4a3828"/>
      <rect x="63" y="83" width="11" height="5" rx="2" fill="#4a3828"/>
      <rect x="77" y="83" width="11" height="5" rx="2" fill="#4a3828"/>
      <path d="M28 52 Q10 42 18 60 Q8 56 20 70" stroke="#8a7868" stroke-width="3.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <ellipse cx="58" cy="62" rx="18" ry="7" fill="#c8baa8" opacity="0.45"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <div class="card-title">🍡 北京名点·驴打滚</div>
  <div class="card-text">
    驴打滚是北京传统小吃，因制成后撒满黄豆面，形似驴儿打滚扬起的尘土而得名。以糯米粉为皮，裹入红豆沙馅，外滚黄豆粉，软糯香甜，豆香浓郁。
  </div>
  <div class="card-foot">🫏 打个滚 ≈ 一口糯糯的满足 🍡</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
